WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.325
Privacy Surveillance.

00:00:02.275 --> 00:00:11.737
The boys who stormed Juno Beach didn't wade through machine-gun fire so that eighty years later their grandchildren could be monitored by their own government without a warrant.

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:21.737
From Vimy to Kapyong to Kandahar, Canadians bled for the liberties now being legislated away — bill by bill, order by order, algorithm by algorithm.

00:00:21.737 --> 00:00:35.262
This report documents the architecture of surveillance being erected in Canada, names the legislation enabling it, and cites the courts, commissioners, and oversight bodies sounding the alarm that Parliament refuses to hear.
